    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "finding my way back to what though? everything i used to love is just... gone. my friends, my health, even the ability to just get around my own house without it being a whole struggle. it feels like the world has moved on and left me in this waiting room. it just feels so pointless to keep fighting for a life that's already mostly lost.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
